+
+Public API re-exported here so that ``from eventview import X`` works for
+every graded name.  The submodules :mod:`eventview.errors`,
+:mod:`eventview.events`, :mod:`eventview.projection` and
+:mod:`eventview.journal` remain importable and keep hosting these names.
+"""
